# Where the SearchMirror app is served, when the marketing page is NOT on the
# same origin as it. Leave blank for a same-origin deployment (a proxy serving
# this dist/ at / and the app under it) -- the auth links stay relative.
#
# Set it for a split deployment, and for `pnpm dev`, where this site runs on
# :5180 and the app on :3001. Without it, "Get started" and "Sign in" resolve
# against :5180, which has no such routes and answers with this page again.
VITE_APP_ORIGIN=
